{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11204140","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11204140","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1120414001:0":{"text":"四处打听了一圈，感觉……伽利，请你代笔写信的那个贾克松，好像在咸水镇民中的评价并不好。","source_cn":"四处打听了一圈，感觉……伽利，请你代笔写信的那个贾克松...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x619B956D8407A7AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120414002:0":{"text":"他究竟是个怎样的人？","source_cn":"他究竟是个怎样的人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0798F647544DB508","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120414003:0":{"text":"他？刚才有人形容得比较准确，贾克松面相很凶。","source_cn":"他？刚才有人形容得比较准确，贾克松面相很凶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAE07D34CB6D3CC1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120414004:0":{"text":"但外表只是假象，我们不能光从骨骼和皮肤上判断一个人！最重要的是，在沙暴中躲避的时候，他把剩余不多的水让给我喝了。","source_cn":"但外表只是假象，我们不能光从骨骼和皮肤上判断一个人！最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE405E8F5999890E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120414005:0":{"text":"在深红高原，多一口水，就多一分活下去的可能性，学会自然学识的手册上是这么说的。所以我帮他写信，给他另一种活下去的希望！","source_cn":"在深红高原，多一口水，就多一分活下去的可能性，学会自然...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA676EB7AA3641EE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120414006:0":{"text":"这封信一定得交到贾克松母亲手里，为此，我愿意暂停一天的田野调查！","source_cn":"这封信一定得交到贾克松母亲手里，为此，我愿意暂停一天的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8540E330C2C254F2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120414007:0":{"text":"嘿！你们！刚才有人在说贾克松，是不是？他回来了吗？","source_cn":"嘿！你们！刚才有人在说贾克松，是不是？他回来了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99F3ED73A559BF11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120414008:0":{"text":"嗯，是谁在插话……？","source_cn":"嗯，是谁在插话……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A6F511888219E43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:梅丽莎":{"text":"梅丽莎","source":"梅丽莎","status":"source"},"speaker:伽利":{"text":"伽利","source":"伽利","status":"source"},"speaker:突兀的声音":{"text":"突兀的声音","source":"突兀的声音","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}